WEBVTT

00:09:57.532 --> 00:10:00.754
En we geven ze de moed
om hun dromen na te jagen,

00:10:00.778 --> 00:10:03.066
in de echte wereld, in onze tijd.

00:10:03.090 --> 00:10:04.249
Dank je wel.

00:10:04.273 --> 00:10:07.921
(Applaus)

00:10:07.945 --> 00:10:09.096
Dank je wel.

00:10:09.120 --> 00:10:12.590
(Applaus)